{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他再守着熟悉的分寸，心里忽然有些难受。尝过亲近带来的真实满足后，收住渴望也像是在压低自己真正需要的东西。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始感到，维持掌控的克制会压低自己已经确认的需要。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这条线把此刻的不适解释为克制开始带来的代价，紧扣他既想延续亲近又想保有掌控的内在冲突。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选3\",\n        \"候选7\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他忽然觉得不踏实，越珍惜这份亲近，越怕自己会失去它。曾经真切得到过安慰，让他开始把这份靠近当作依靠。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始把亲近视为自身安稳的一种依靠，失去它的可能也因此变得切身。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"这条线把不安解释为亲近从真实的满足变成了情感上的依靠，重点是珍惜所带来的脆弱，而非克制本身的代价。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选9\",\n        \"候选14\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eb3b6ff1-c99d-4b3f-8a26-175ab004c781", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T020206293835Z", "elapsed_seconds": 102.89, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:03:49.202977+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "be36d76033e58b0e248acc3093ffb080a07c6ee4bcfffc12e9aab73c818bc948", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt